OL,3,GNEWSACuts 'highly likely' as council
OL,4,Afaces #38m gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said it is likely to ask
OL,7,Fthe government for exceptional
OL,8,Ffinancial support, warning that cuts to
OL,9,Fservices are "highly likely".
OL,11,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,12,F(BCP) Council is forecasting a #38m gap
OL,13,Fin its budget for 2027/28.
OL,15,FIt also faces pressures of more than
OL,16,F#32m this year if no action is taken,
OL,17,Fand is urging the government to cover
OL,18,Fthe final 10% of its special
OL,19,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,20,F(SEND) debt, after ministers agreed to
OL,21,Ffund the rest earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
