OL,3,GNEWSACuts 'highly likely' as council
OL,4,Afaces #38m gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Department for Education (DfE)
OL,7,Fspokesperson said the High Needs
OL,8,FStability Grant was the largest ever
OL,9,Fgovernment intervention on council SEND
OL,10,Fdeficits, worth more than #5bn
OL,11,Fnationally.
